{
  "title": "花 260 元连测 3 款主流编程 AI，我把呼声最高的那个退订了",
  "author": "袁六伟",
  "digest": "",
  "content": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:0 auto;background:#fffef8;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:#555555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;overflow-x:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:12px 20px 30px;background:#fffef8;border:2px solid #1a1a1a;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a1a;\"><section style=\"background:#C8102E;padding:10px 18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><section style=\"color:#fffef8;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:700;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI CODING BENCHMARK</span></section><section style=\"color:#fffef8;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">★★★★☆</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;\"><section style=\"flex:1;padding:22px 18px;border-right:2px dashed #FECACA;\"><p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;text-decoration:line-through;\"><span leaf=\"\">跑分第一就等于写代码最强</span></p><p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 0 4px;line-height:1.25;\"><span leaf=\"\">连测3款编程AI</span><span style=\"color:#C8102E;\"><span leaf=\"\">最火的那个</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#C8102E;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.25;\"><span leaf=\"\">被我当场退订了</span></p><section style=\"border-top:1px dashed #FECACA;margin-bottom:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"font-size:13px;color:#555555;line-height:1.75;padding:10px 12px;background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FECACA;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">3轮真实工程压测 · 4张实拍对比 · 2份可抄配置单</span></p></section><section style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><section style=\"font-size:10px;color:#C8102E;border:1px solid #C8102E;padding:3px 9px;\"><span leaf=\"\">#真实压测</span></section><section style=\"font-size:10px;color:#C8102E;border:1px solid #C8102E;padding:3px 9px;\"><span leaf=\"\">#避坑指南</span></section><section style=\"font-size:10px;color:#C8102E;border:1px solid #C8102E;padding:3px 9px;\"><span leaf=\"\">#算账对比</span></section></section></section><section style=\"width:52px;padding:14px 4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#FEF2F2;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:8px;color:#999999;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NO.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:#C8102E;margin:2px 0 0;\"><span leaf=\"\">042</span></p></section><section style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888888;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;line-height:1.3;\"><span leaf=\"\">实测<br>凭证</span></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:8px;color:#999999;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GRADE</span></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#C8102E;margin:2px 0 0;\"><span leaf=\"\">A</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:0 8px;\"><section style=\"flex:1;border-top:2px dashed #FECACA;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"padding:0 8px;font-size:10px;color:#C8102E;\"><span leaf=\"\">✂</span></section><section style=\"flex:1;border-top:2px dashed #FECACA;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section></section><section style=\"padding:8px 18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#999999;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">花真金白银踩坑 · 直接抄结论</span></p><p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#999999;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">2026.11.12 · VERIFIED</span></p></section></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">昨晚为了把公司内部 1200 行的旧版排版脚本改成全自动流水线，我连开了三个终端窗口。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">我把同一份重构任务同时丢给目前呼声最高的三款编程模型。结果账单扣掉 260 块钱，跑分最火的那个反而最先在基础正则上卡死循环。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果你最近也在纠结该续费哪家编程会员，或者天天被 AI 改出的报错代码折腾，今天这篇真跑实测能直接帮你省下一笔冤枉钱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:22px 20px 0;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/demo/01-terminal-bench.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;text-align:center;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 20px 26px;\"><span leaf=\"\">— 三款模型同题压测终端首屏实拍</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">（三款模型在同一工程目录下执行重构任务的终端实拍）</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:36px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><section style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">PART 01</span></section><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">先看省流胜负总表，谁在真干活一目了然</span></p></section></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">我不喜欢把结论藏在最后逼你翻屏。这次一共跑了「复杂表格内联化」「跨文件改接口」「脏 HTML 乱码清洗」三道真题，先上最终成绩单：</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:20px 20px 24px;overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">评测模型</span></th><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">一次点亮率</span></th><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">跨文件重构耗时</span></th><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">单次任务成本</span></th><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">致命短板</span></th><th style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;\"><span leaf=\"\">站队结论</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">Claude (主力款)</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">3/3 全过</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">42 秒</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\">¥1.15</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\">API 并发限流严</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">主力闭眼入</strong></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">模型 B (高跑分款)</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\">1/3 跑通</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\">118 秒</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\">¥0.85</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\">爱删已有注释与逻辑</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#FEF2F2;\"><span leaf=\"\">仅适合写单函数</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">DeepSeek (性价比款)</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\">2/3 跑通</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\">65 秒</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">¥0.09</strong></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\">前端细节需微调</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#555555;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">日常平替首选</strong></span></td></tr></tbody></table></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">从表里能直接看出来，官方榜单上差不多的选手，一旦放进超过 3 个文件的真实本地项目里，体感差距简直是两个物种。</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:36px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><section style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">PART 02</span></section><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">亮出压测考卷：用同一套毒舌指令逼出真实极限</span></p></section></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">很多测评只拿“写个贪吃蛇小游戏”糊弄人，那种题目现在随便一个开源小模型都能背出标准答案。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了测出它们在一人公司真实生产环境里的底裤，我直接用了下面这套带严格约束的工程重构 Prompt。你可以直接复制去测你手头的工具：</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:20px 20px;padding:14px;background:#F3F4F6;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-left:3px solid #C8102E;border-radius:4px;font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#1a1a1a;white-space:pre-wrap;\">【实战压测考卷 · 公众号内联 CSS 消毒与装配】\n请读取当前目录下的 markdown_to_wechat.py，在不引入任何第三方依赖的前提下完成以下 3 项改造：\n1. 将所有 Markdown 表格转换为 100% 内联 style 的 &lt;table&gt;，偶数行底色设为 #FEF2F2，表头底色设为 #C8102E；\n2. 拦截并清除正文文本节点中的双重转义（&amp;amp;quot;）与残留反引号，但必须完整保留 white-space:pre-wrap 代码块内的原始字符；\n3. 直接输出完整可运行的修改后文件，严禁使用 &quot;// 其余代码保持不变&quot; 省略任何一行。</section>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:22px 20px 0;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/demo/02-round1-diff.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;text-align:center;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 20px 26px;\"><span leaf=\"\">— 第一轮单次跑通率与代码完整性对比</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">（左为 Claude 一次生成的完整内联表格代码，右为模型 B 偷懒省略了 80 行核心逻辑）</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:36px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><section style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">PART 03</span></section><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">惊艳瞬间与翻车抓包：最怕 AI 一本正经地给你删代码</span></p></section></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一轮跑下来，<strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">Claude 是全场唯一严格遵守“不许省略代码”且一次跑通测试的选手</strong>。它甚至主动给微信分割线补上了防剥离占位符。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">反观呼声很高的模型 B，表面上吐字飞快，打开文件却发现它为了省 Token，悄悄把处理图片路径校验的 40 多行原代码直接删掉了。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">更让人血压升高的是，当我把报错日志贴回去让它修时，它在同一个正则表达式上连续改了四次都没跳出来，白白烧掉六万多 Token。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:22px 20px 0;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/demo/03-loop-fail.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;text-align:center;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 20px 26px;\"><span leaf=\"\">— 模型B连续四轮死循环修改同一行正则的翻车记录</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">（连续 4 次把原本正常的正则改崩，陷入死循环）</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">而国产阵营的 DeepSeek 表现出了极高的性价比。虽然首轮漏掉了一个边框属性，但喂入报错后第二轮立刻精准修好，跑完一整套还不到一毛钱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:22px 20px 0;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/demo/04-billing-sheet.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px;display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;text-align:center;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 20px 26px;\"><span leaf=\"\">— 后台API真实扣费账单与Token消耗对比</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">（OpenRouter 与官方后台实测账单截屏 · 2026/11/12 查）</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:36px 20px 20px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #1a1a1a;\"><section style=\"background:#C8102E;color:#ffffff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">PART END</span></section><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0;line-height:1.4;\"><span leaf=\"\">算清真金白银：给你一份直接照抄的选型配置单</span></p></section></section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">光看效果不算账就是耍流氓。我核对了 2026 年 11 月 12 日的官网最新标价和三天实测消耗，发现如果大小活全用顶配模型，月账单很容易破千。</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">最省钱也最稳的做法是按任务难度分级路由，下面这份配置单你可以直接抄进自己的工具链里：</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:20px 20px;padding:14px;background:#F3F4F6;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-left:3px solid #C8102E;border-radius:4px;font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#1a1a1a;white-space:pre-wrap;\"># 一人公司 AI 编程与自动化分级路由清单（2026.11 实测版）\n主力攻坚层 (占比 20%):\n  适用场景: 跨文件架构重构 / 复杂前端排版 / 诡异 Bug 排查\n  推荐方案: Claude 主力模型 (官网 Pro $20/月 或 API 按量)\n  ✓ 优势: 一次点亮率极高，几乎不用人工返工擦屁股\n  ✗ 避坑: 别拿它跑大批量简单文本清洗，纯属烧钱\n\n日常走量层 (占比 80%):\n  适用场景: 写单文件处理脚本 / 批量数据格式转换 / 正则提取\n  推荐方案: DeepSeek 官方 API (输入 ¥1/百万Token，输出 ¥2/百万Token · 11/12 官网价)\n  ✓ 优势: 成本不到海外旗舰的十分之一，中文理解极稳\n  ✗ 避坑: 复杂 UI 样式需要明确给出色值与像素参数\n\n坚决劝退项:\n  ✗ 凡是在修改代码时喜欢用 &quot;// ...其余代码省略&quot; 偷懒的模型会员，立刻关掉自动续费。</section>\n<p style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#555555;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 20px 16px;text-align:justify;\"><span leaf=\"\"><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:600;\">贵模型的价值在于省下你反复调试的命，便宜模型的价值在于跑通后的规模化走量。</strong> 今晚回去先把你的默认模型拆成高低两档，下月账单至少立省一半。</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin:40px 20px 20px;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:1px;background:#D1D5DB;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#C8102E;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:700;\"><span leaf=\"\">END</span></span><span style=\"width:44px;height:1px;background:#D1D5DB;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 20px 28px;padding:16px 18px;background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FECACA;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果你觉得今天这篇实测帮你省了时间，欢迎</span><strong style=\"color:#C8102E;font-weight:700;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、在看、转发</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">三连，我们下篇硬核实测见。</span></p></section></section>",
